  featureName: 'Complete UGUI Demo '
  shortDescription: Explore a complete working reference implementation.
  fullDescription: "The Complete UGUI Demo is a fully working Unity project that
    shows how Trailback fits into a real application.\n\nIt brings the framework's
    core features together in a single scene, making it easy to explore the navigation
    flow, understand how the different components interact, and see how a complete
    integration is structured.\n\nFeatures include:\n\n\u2022 Complete Working Integration\n\u2022
    Core Navigation Features\n\u2022 Reference Samples\n\u2022 Production-Style Architecture\n\nThe
    demo is a great starting point for learning Trailback. Explore it, experiment
    with it, and use it as a reference while integrating the framework into your
    own project."
  screenshots: []
  videoUrl: https://youtu.be/adPRJ59t6w8
